    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/33b1c81bfd21e1dabc202f67f40d7376.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONEiRA is a narrative-driven puzzle-platformer where your choices matter. Explore a world where dreams are sold as entertainment and your job is to ensure each is market-ready. Inspect virtual dreamscapes and untangle the trauma hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/f3ffdb06a40b47c8cc378cdcd9bb014a.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/6f658fd57ff2da5c796b65abca61c080.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories don\u2019t fade\u2014they hide. As you perform your inspection, cryptic messages and lingering voices will pull you deep into a psychological mystery. Sharpen your senses and help the minds behind the dreams process their deeply rooted pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/eddb569273a62c16b66d350dac272ee1.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/67edb3004f6e14918600917126488718.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just tread carefully, as every choice you make alters the story and world around you. Listen closely to the characters that you encounter on your journey, as some may know more than they let on. Will you uncover what lies beneath, or lose yourself in the dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/f089b3ab96b5bd0fc631c8e14bd624f5.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/dd2ba97306d61466f8117899ba4f5717.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, the company has equipped you with a full arsenal of specialized gear. Collect and manage unique abilities to overcome puzzles, navigate obstacles, and explore the ever-shifting dreamscapes. Get ready to suit up\u2014and don\u2019t forget to <strong>wishlist ONEiRA today</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/f156998b3fe7ceca9c0fb6be512cb5fe.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> ONEiRA is a work in progress, and the images shown may not reflect the final game</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/33b1c81bfd21e1dabc202f67f40d7376.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ONEiRA is a narrative-driven puzzle-platformer where your choices matter. Explore a world where dreams are sold as entertainment and your job is to ensure each is market-ready. Inspect virtual dreamscapes and untangle the trauma hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/f3ffdb06a40b47c8cc378cdcd9bb014a.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/6f658fd57ff2da5c796b65abca61c080.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories don\u2019t fade\u2014they hide. As you perform your inspection, cryptic messages and lingering voices will pull you deep into a psychological mystery. Sharpen your senses and help the minds behind the dreams process their deeply rooted pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/eddb569273a62c16b66d350dac272ee1.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/67edb3004f6e14918600917126488718.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just tread carefully, as every choice you make alters the story and world around you. Listen closely to the characters that you encounter on your journey, as some may know more than they let on. Will you uncover what lies beneath, or lose yourself in the dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/f089b3ab96b5bd0fc631c8e14bd624f5.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/dd2ba97306d61466f8117899ba4f5717.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, the company has equipped you with a full arsenal of specialized gear. Collect and manage unique abilities to overcome puzzles, navigate obstacles, and explore the ever-shifting dreamscapes. Get ready to suit up\u2014and don\u2019t forget to <strong>wishlist ONEiRA today</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521080/extras/f156998b3fe7ceca9c0fb6be512cb5fe.avif?t=1751550798\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> ONEiRA is a work in progress, and the images shown may not reflect the final game</p>",
