        "notes": "ONEiRA explores emotional and psychological themes through a surreal and symbolic narrative. The game includes depictions of psychological distress, loss, grief, and symbolic portrayals of violence and emotional manipulation. \r\n\r\nPlayers may encounter narrative elements involving emotionally intense scenes that reflect on identity, morality, and fractured memory. These themes are presented thoughtfully and with a narrative purpose but may not be suitable for all audiences. \r\n\r\nThe game does NOT contain explicit depictions of sexual acts."
